; ---- BRK 3 (CC) / BRK imm8 (CD) / BRKV (CE): V20 INT3 0104, INT_N 0108, INTO 010C + INT 01EC-01FC
; (the vector's two reads from segment 0, PSW pushed with IE and BRK cleared (CITF), PS and PC
; pushed, PS and PC loaded, FLUSH E). The type byte popped as a port number (no take sync: the
; frozen model's chained take); BRKV's V test (the format's condition, 70's)
routine brk_imm op=CD resv=e book="BRK imm8" diff=3 why="OPEN: silicon longer than the book, as BRK 3 (F37-push-brk-brk3-pE-w0), the type byte popped on the first word (F37-push-brk-brk5-pE-w0)"
    pop=port jmp=brk_b1                     ; pop the type byte (into IL); into BRK's body
routine brkv op=CE book="BRKV" xc=t diff=t:4 why="OPEN: silicon longer than the book: BRK 4 on V, BRK 3's body (F37-push-brk-brk3-pE-w0); not taken the decide and E (V20 INTO 010C-010D)"
